{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":40,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝对祂子民的安慰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你们的上帝说：",{"text":"“你们要安慰安慰我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要劝慰耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向她宣告，她的苦难已经结束，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的罪恶已经被除去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她因自己的一切罪已受到耶和华加倍的惩罚","poem":1},{"noteId":19},{"text":"。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"有人高喊：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“在旷野预备耶和华的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在沙漠修直我们上帝的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一切山谷要被填满，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山小丘要被削平；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坎坷之地要变得平坦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"崎岖之地要成为平原。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的荣耀必彰显，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人必一同看见。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华亲口说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"有声音说：“呼喊吧！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我问道：“我呼喊什么呢？”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那声音说：“芸芸众生尽如草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荣华纷缛像野地的花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华吹一口气，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"草就枯干，花也凋谢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人类诚然如草。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"草必枯干，花必凋谢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我们上帝的话永远长存。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"报好消息的锡安啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要登上高山！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报好消息的耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要大声宣告！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要高声说，不要害怕！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要对犹大的城邑说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们的上帝来了！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，主耶和华带着能力来了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的臂膀执掌王权；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，祂带着赏赐而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要酬劳祂的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像牧人一样牧养自己的羊群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用臂膀把羊羔聚在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抱在怀中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"温柔地引导母羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"谁曾用手心量海水？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁曾用手掌度苍天？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁曾用升斗盛大地的尘土？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁曾用秤称高山，用天平称丘陵？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁曾测度耶和华的心？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁曾做祂的谋士指点祂？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂受过谁的点悟？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁教过祂公正之道？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁教过祂知识？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁传授过祂悟性之道？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，列国就像水桶中的一滴水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如天平上的尘埃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，祂举起众海岛，好像捧起微尘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的树木不够作献祭的柴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它林中的走兽也不够作燔祭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国在祂面前都不算什么，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在祂看来还不如虚无。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"你们拿谁与上帝相比呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们用什么形象比作上帝呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像是工匠制造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金匠替它镶金、打造银链。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"买不起这种偶像的人就选一块耐用的木头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找个能工巧匠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雕出一个可以站立不倒的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"难道你们不知道吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你们没有听过吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不是从起初就告诉过你们吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道从大地奠立根基以来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们一直没有明白吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝坐在大地的圆圈之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的人类好像蚱蜢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂铺展诸天，就像铺展幔子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"展开诸天，如展开居住的帐篷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使掌权者归于无有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使世上的审判官化为虚无。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们刚被栽上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刚被种上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刚在土里扎根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝一吹，他们便枯干了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴风将他们像碎秸一样吹去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"圣者说：“你们拿谁与我相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之与我同等呢？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们向天举目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看是谁创造了这万象？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是谁把众星一一领出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按各自的名字叫它们？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的权柄和能力伟大无比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们一个也不会少。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，你怎能说耶和华看不见你的遭遇呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你怎能说上帝无视你的冤情呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你不知道？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你没有听见过？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华是永恒的上帝，是创造地极的主宰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不会疲乏，也不会困倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的智慧深不可测。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂赐疲乏的人能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给软弱的人加力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使青年也会疲乏困倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"强壮的人也会踉跄跌倒；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但仰望耶和华的人必重新得力。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必像鹰一样展翅高飞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们奔跑也不困倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们行走也不疲乏。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":19,"caller":"+","text":"“她因自己的一切罪已受到耶和华加倍的惩罚”或译“她的一切罪已得到耶和华双倍的赦免”。","reference":{"chapter":40,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/40.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/41.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/39.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}